We derive the radial ordinary differential equation satisfied by the 
canonical envelope $f(r)$ in the attractor solution


\[
\phi_\ast(x)
=
f(r)
\left(
1 + \sum_{\ell,m} a_{\ell m} Y_{\ell m}(\hat{x})
\right).
